{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 50, "timestamp": 1770948810, "env": {"SHELL": "/bin/bash", "TERM": "xterm-256color"}, "title": "Anthropic vs AWS Bedrock — Same Claude Model, Two Providers"}
[0.005147, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m\r\n  ╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗\r\n  ║                                                                   ║\r\n  ║   Anthropic vs AWS Bedrock — Same Claude Model, Two Providers     ║\r\n  ║                                                                   ║\r\n  ║   Per-user keys from Authorino · Provider-specific auth formats   ║\r\n  ║                                                                   ║\r\n  ╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝\r\n\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[1mArchitecture:\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2m┌──────────┐   ┌──────────────┐   ┌────────────────┐   ┌───────────────────────────────┐\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m│          │   │ Envoy :8801  │   │ Semantic Router│ ┬→│ \u001b[0m\u001b[35mAnthropic\u001b[0m\u001b[2m  api.anthropic.com  │\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m│  Client  │ → │              │ → │ ext_proc :50051│ │ │  x-api-key: {key}             │\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m│          │   │ ext_authz ───│─→ │                │ │ └───────────────────────────────┘\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m│          │   │ Authorino    │   │                │ │ ┌───────────────────────────────┐\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m│          │   │ :50052       │   │                │ └→│ \u001b[0m\u001b[33mBedrock\u001b[0m\u001b[2m  bedrock-runtime..  │\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m│          │   │              │   │                │   │  Authorization: Bearer {sigv4} │\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m└──────────┘   └──────────────┘   └────────────────┘   └───────────────────────────────┘\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mSame model, different auth:\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mProvider           Profile Type       Auth Header              Path                  \u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m──────────────── ──────────────── ────────────────────── ────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[35mAnthropic         \u001b[0m anthropic          x-api-key: {key}         /v1/messages          \r\n  \u001b[33mAWS Bedrock       \u001b[0m bedrock            Authorization: Bearer    /model/.../converse   \r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mUsers:\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mUser         Anthropic Key        Bedrock Key         \u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.005712, "o", "  \u001b[2m────────── ────────────────── ──────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n  alice        \u001b[35msk-ant-alice-...    \u001b[0m \u001b[33malice-bedrock-sigv4-...\u001b[0m\r\n  bob          \u001b[35msk-ant-bob-...      \u001b[0m \u001b[2m—                 \u001b[0m\r\n  carol        \u001b[2m—                 \u001b[0m \u001b[33mcarol-bedrock-sigv4-...\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[2mNOTE: All tokens are FAKE. Provider error messages prove correct routing:\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  Anthropic: \"invalid x-api-key\" → reached Anthropic, x-api-key header used\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  Bedrock:   \"security token...is invalid\" → reached Bedrock, Bearer used\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[3.00686, "o", "\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1mDiscovering user tokens from K8s Secrets...\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[3.142982, "o", "  user-alice: \u001b[2mab-alice-token-1111\u001b[0m\r\n  user-bob:   \u001b[2mab-bob-token-2222\u001b[0m\r\n  user-carol: \u001b[2mab-carol-token-3333\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[6.144196, "o", "\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m"]
[6.144364, "o", "\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[46m\u001b[97m PART 1 \u001b[0m  \u001b[1mSame Claude model → Anthropic vs Bedrock\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  Alice has keys for both providers.\r\n  Explicit model aliases force routing to a specific provider.\r\n  \u001b[2mExpect: Anthropic returns \"invalid x-api-key\", Bedrock returns \"security token...invalid\"\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[9.145627, "o", "\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[46m\u001b[97m TEST 1 \u001b[0m  \u001b[1mAlice → claude-sonnet-4-anthropic (Anthropic direct, x-api-key header)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[10.147023, "o", "  \u001b[1m\u001b[33mREQUEST\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mcurl -s http://127.0.0.1:8801/v1/chat/completions \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -H \"Authorization: Bearer ab-alice-token-1111...\" \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -d '{\"model\": \"claude-sonnet-4-anthropic\", \"messages\": [{...}], \"max_tokens\": 60}'\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  # expected: HTTP 401\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[11.224609, "o", "  \u001b[1m\u001b[32mPASS — HTTP 401 (expected 401)\u001b[0m\r\n  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n  │ \u001b[1mhttp_status:\u001b[0m     401\r\n  │ \u001b[1mserver:\u001b[0m          envoy\r\n  │ \u001b[1mcontent-type:\u001b[0m    application/json\r\n"]
[11.244077, "o", "  │\r\n  │ \u001b[1mResponse body (error details):\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[11.272092, "o", "  │   {\r\n  │     \"type\": \"error\",\r\n  │     \"error\": {\r\n  │       \"type\": \"authentication_error\",\r\n  │       \"message\": \"invalid x-api-key\"\r\n  │     },\r\n  │     \"request_id\": \"req_011CY5G2opShESHLBggmstmT\"\r\n  │   }\r\n  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n"]
[14.274392, "o", "\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[46m\u001b[97m TEST 2 \u001b[0m  \u001b[1mAlice → claude-sonnet-4-bedrock (AWS Bedrock, Authorization: Bearer header)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[15.275808, "o", "  \u001b[1m\u001b[33mREQUEST\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2mcurl -s http://127.0.0.1:8801/v1/chat/completions \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -H \"Authorization: Bearer ab-alice-token-1111...\" \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\033[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  -d '{\"model\": \"claude-sonnet-4-bedrock\", \"messages\": [{...}], \"max_tokens\": 60}'\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[2m  # expected: HTTP 403\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[16.361324, "o", "  \u001b[1m\u001b[32mPASS — HTTP 403 (expected 403)\u001b[0m\r\n  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n  │ \u001b[1mhttp_status:\u001b[0m     403\r\n  │ \u001b[1mserver:\u001b[0m          envoy\r\n  │ \u001b[1mcontent-type:\u001b[0m    application/json\r\n"]
[16.380874, "o", "  │\r\n  │ \u001b[1mResponse body (error details):\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[16.399914, "o", "  │   {\r\n  │     \"Message\": \"Invalid API Key format: Must start with pre-defined prefix\"\r\n  │   }\r\n  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n"]
[19.402579, "o", "\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[45m\u001b[97m PART 2 \u001b[0m  \u001b[1mFailover — claude-sonnet-4-20250514 (Anthropic → Bedrock)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  The default model prefers Anthropic but can fail over to Bedrock.\r\n  Alice (both keys) routes to preferred Anthropic.\r\n  \u001b[2mExpect: Anthropic auth error (proves it went to preferred provider)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[22.404227, "o", "\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[46m\u001b[97m TEST 3 \u001b[0m  \u001b[1mAlice → claude-sonnet-4-20250514 (prefers Anthropic)\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
