[27.523933, "o", "\u001b[2m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1m\u001b[42m\u001b[97m PART 3 \u001b[0m  \u001b[1mPer-User Key Isolation\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  Bob has only an Anthropic key → succeeds reaching Anthropic.\r\n  Carol has only a Bedrock key → succeeds reaching Bedrock.\r\n  \u001b[2mExpect: different error messages proving different providers + different keys\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
